731
01:05:01,002 --> 01:05:02,241
Resist that.

732
01:05:02,532 --> 01:05:11,204
An evidence collection pipeline with narrowly scoped, explicitly enumerated permissions is itself stronger evidence

733
01:05:11,495 --> 01:05:20,167
of least privilege discipline than one built on a convenient but overly broad policy,

734
01:05:20,459 --> 01:05:29,131
and a careful auditor reviewing your IAM configuration during fieldwork will absolutely notice the

735
01:05:29,422 --> 01:05:31,900
difference between the two.

736
01:05:32,191 --> 01:05:40,863
Let's also talk about what happens the very first time this pipeline actually fails

