01:06:19,157 --> 01:06:27,830
Document that specific incident, briefly, in your own internal notes, not because it needs

743
01:06:28,121 --> 01:06:36,793
to become a formal finding, but because a pattern of the same collection step

744
01:06:37,084 --> 01:06:45,756
failing repeatedly over time is itself a signal that something about that specific evidence

