01:21:58,581 --> 01:22:02,081
LECTURE 6 — THE AUDITOR WALKTHROUGH

895
01:22:03,081 --> 01:22:10,279
Let's completely reframe what a walkthrough actually is, because most people walk in with

896
01:22:10,559 --> 01:22:17,756
the wrong mental model entirely, and that wrong model is what causes the nerves.

