01:22:18,036 --> 01:22:24,205
This is not a performance, and it is absolutely not an interrogation.

898
01:22:24,485 --> 01:22:31,682
It's a structured conversation, typically sixty to ninety minutes, entrance conference style, with your

899
01:22:31,962 --> 01:22:39,160
