02:02:20,456 --> 02:02:25,062
you're actually ready to make right now.

1289
02:02:25,352 --> 02:02:34,564
The auditor walkthrough is you defending that claim live, in the room, with real

1290
02:02:34,854 --> 02:02:38,144
evidence pulled up on demand.

1291
02:02:38,433 --> 02:02:47,646
Remediation planning is honest, proactive handling of exactly where the claim isn't fully true

1292
02:02:47,935 --> 02:02:48,835
yet.

