02:02:49,124 --> 02:02:58,337
And evidence assembly is the one command proof, instantly available, for absolutely any sampled

1294
02:02:58,626 --> 02:03:02,574
day an auditor could possibly choose.

1295
02:03:02,864 --> 02:03:10,102
You are not theoretically ready for a Type One audit anymore.

1296
02:03:10,391 --> 02:03:19,604
You have real, contemporaneous, immutable evidence that a complete stranger holding a CPA license

1297
02:03:19,893 --> 02:03:29,106
